~
You see before you a gakrag.  The gakrag are a humanoid race who appear to be
half ape and half oxen.  This one is quite large.  It's entire body is covered
in long, white fur which does nothing to hide huge muscles rippling under it's
skin.  It is painfully apparent it is enormously strong. It is also obvious it
possesses a fair amount of agility for it's size.  It's head is shaped like an
oxen's, along with the downswept horns but instead of long, upright ears it
has ears like an ape, below and behind it's horns.  The most notable feature
about it, though, is it's eyes.  It's pupils are the colorless white in white
which usually indicates blindness.  The gakrag are not, however, blind, as is
evidenced by the way it's eyes continually dart all over the room searching
for bodies to rend.  While you recognize the gift of vision in it's eyes, one
gift you do NOT see is intelligence.  It's mental faculties seem horribly
limited to the point of being an absolute moron.
~
