#34512
F W 2~
kralus god~
Kralus~
A huge, glowing man is in the room.
~
You see before you a huge, glowing male figure.  If his size and beauty was
not enough, then the 'feeling' of him as you stand in the same room should be
more than enough to convince you that you are standing before a diety.  He
looks to be somewhere around eight feet tall, with broad shoulders, golden
hair and a handsomeness that is breathtaking.  He looks like a great knight as
you would picture from the tales of old.  There is a sadness in his face which
cannot be overlooked that matches the black of his clothing.
~
